Apply resident-app execution guards, sandbox restrictions and native helpers.

The VM guard runs outside Lua's protected-call mechanism and covers every
coroutine. Pattern matching also polls during backtracking. Removing disabled
functions from registration tables lets LTO discard their implementations.
Native ticks and number formatting avoid unsupported libc dependencies.

